# ===== Chromium/Edge profile 误落项目根（2026-11-21 --user-data-dir 事故）=====
# 浏览器自动化/agent 若把 user-data-dir 指到项目目录，Edge 会把整套 profile 写进仓库根，
# 含 Login Data / Network\Cookies / Web Data / History（账号密码、登录态、浏览记录），
# 一律忽略，避免误提交。
/Local State
/Last Browser
/Last Version
/First Run
/FirstLaunchAfterInstallation
/Variations
/VariationsSafeSeedV2
/VariationsRuntimeSeedV2
/VariationsSeedV2
/Functional SAN Data
/Functional SAN Data-wal
/Ad Blocking/
/Autofill/
/AutoLaunchProtocolsComponent/
/BrowserMetrics/
/CertificateRevocation/
/component_crx_cache/
/Crashpad/
/DeferredBrowserMetrics/
/Default/
/Domain Actions/
/EADPData Component/
/Edge*/
/extensions_crx_cache/
/FirstPartySetsPreloaded/
/GPUPersistentCache/
/GrShaderCache/
/hyphen-data/
/MEIPreload/
/Nurturing/
/OnDeviceHeadSuggestModel/
/OriginTrials/
/PKIMetadata/
/ProvenanceData*/
/RecoveryImproved/
/SafetyTips/
/ShaderCache/
/Speech Recognition/
/Subresource Filter/
/Trust Protection Lists/
/TrustTokenKeyCommitments/
/Typosquatting/
/Web Notifications Deny List/
/Well Known Domains/
/WidevineCdm/
/WorkspacesNavigationComponent/
/ZxcvbnData/

